#: scenario4:scenario4_7E77A93C_97B6_46DB_90A6_D4C6E3A505A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2a3188fdb8759a9083f59b79d4ec1b89aa152908f4a7bc9d8153dad92f4eca4
#. default-sha256: ab048a5e2a576c4514bc87471c19a530064e02a2bf70cb982fdc0113a1afc300
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7E77A93C_97B6_46DB_90A6_D4C6E3A505A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hmm?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is someone at the door?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫………？　⟪k:3⟫誰か、⟪k:4⟫来たのかしら……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C11C86C8_E501_4EDE_B209_83D989A12E52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7921e678b036614837b92bf543bb9aceffc24986b2f47e83283e6069a2e323f
#. default-sha256: ce9ee339a72a91efc6cdee6b059b0a347983b1229a3ddb810d94af8cf8d12d67
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C11C86C8_E501_4EDE_B209_83D989A12E52"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The flow of time was hazy within the mansion’s walls. ⟪k:1⟫They had little way of telling "
"whether it was night or day, preventing them from knowing exactly how much time had passed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫暗闇の屋敷では時の流れも曖昧でした。⟪k:1⟫時刻を確認する術は限られており、⟪k:2⟫厳密な時間も測"
"ることが出来ません。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_39EB3EAB_7C0F_4D68_B10C_55ED104EAC75
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b682e01a66c3f3ed0c0e0d9d407b2b3a4524ee43bcb5b3d711d2c44fbc86f875
#. default-sha256: 9deb6310b5768a72abeb80c54120a4921012bf9a782218d3831d6ccc965945fb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39EB3EAB_7C0F_4D68_B10C_55ED104EAC75"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had made a habit of climbing the observation tower every so often to "
"see whether the sun was up, which allowed her to approximate the time of day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫時折、⟪k:1⟫物見の塔に登っては陽を確認する――そういった日課を繰り返すことで、⟪k:2⟫どうにか朝と"
"夜を区別していた程度です。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F87761B9_B58B_4448_8629_4751E9B8488E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8be4a0bf793145045f69d76f9ec58b0b8222d55c0e2d2fa32ee0024457dd0737
#. default-sha256: 0307edc366550a22dd33f47ffdc1d1be08644b0bbe5166afc33630f736e7b140
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F87761B9_B58B_4448_8629_4751E9B8488E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Consequently, when she heard the knock on the door, she was not aware just how deep the "
"night was outside—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that forest and beast alike lay quietly at rest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ですから、⟪k:1⟫その何者かの訪れが――動物も自然も押し黙る、⟪k:2⟫深夜であったと、⟪k:3⟫彼女は分"
"かっておりませんでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6C9B35A5_F117_40B3_A387_462780EB00E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1419efe751e45c1eeff6af6f041b12ccaced3dd894d1f0d63fbb0876e002c693
#. default-sha256: eb3135fe4bfd7aec240d1e01a00da76adf6056714af4fdd4ab8f75aca12b1ddd
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6C9B35A5_F117_40B3_A387_462780EB00E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(Oh, right, the stores in the cellar ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ almost exhausted...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（そういえば、⟪k:1⟫倉庫の備蓄が尽きかけていたはず……）"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F662AC6A_109C_4237_B301_A595D078DCE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89462990e67e71598c22d50603a18cf02908a94b4191e298f3ef8b55d22d4384
#. default-sha256: a482d9e871fbcf3fa1e28ee81b8dfedbf13ffb3c7e81ebac417e610282af4a03
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F662AC6A_109C_4237_B301_A595D078DCE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It must be this month’s delivery.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（荷が運ばれてきたのかしら）"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2FDFD391_D01D_430A_8FB5_8AD19682A08A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b074fe602b37807cd8cbd5704b870a84a66387b361549aa85ec64df84578217f
#. default-sha256: 182fa238562490a02b024686dde46fda6215ad578eb7e7e907b4e03b83015514
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2FDFD391_D01D_430A_8FB5_8AD19682A08A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not thinking it was worth bothering Michel over, she made her way out of her chambers and "
"headed for the entrance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女は部屋を後にし、⟪k:1⟫玄関の大扉へと向かいました。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ミシェルの手を煩わすまでもない"
"と、⟪k:4⟫ただ一人で。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A66F8C4E_786F_457E_8E11_6433A05D1710
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 368316b08ee93fba3e158a036ea663ce63311b64efabba82d5298e98ad99c8af
#. default-sha256: 80752aa426c5a779e53973d5b6a7c572c8afb26b11e1c5f2ca7bcb2f8eba2d7f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A66F8C4E_786F_457E_8E11_6433A05D1710"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There had only been a single knock,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫扉を叩く音は、⟪k:1⟫最初の一度きりで、⟪k:2⟫それ以上は聞こえてきませんでした。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫彼女は"
"こう思ったことでしょう。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BBB7D78A_4C7B_4265_83A7_52CF48469070
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72b8a936350eb4ef6378ef3c5a72ca1e733625b459d48568863633bc3563fac7
#. default-sha256: b56ab062b66358331a3dda02ffb79ee439f8ce1dfc112c987ee341935276f3ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BBB7D78A_4C7B_4265_83A7_52CF48469070"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫leading her to conclude that, as before, the servant had simply left the box outside the "
"door."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫以前と同じように、⟪k:1⟫荷だけが外に残されているのだと。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B01D0B15_E1EE_49B9_BD57_10B0CA1C1B60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91b2b7c4953e2a056acf094d8b2b054c8000553255af11df3333222c6bc9c4f9
#. default-sha256: 2d253cf8858b12bd3eafbb28ae52581ec8eb5f08a680dc83c2f2e99276a95dc5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B01D0B15_E1EE_49B9_BD57_10B0CA1C1B60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So without a second thought, she opened the door—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫そうして不用意に扉が開かれ――、⟪k:2⟫彼女は、⟪k:3⟫見たのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FC468F18_DCC6_46B6_AD08_05BC3BCEDF6C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79fedcac435724107b42a61f7c1515be8f6966ab39747b8a8164c8e617415f87
#. default-sha256: ae401fa7c903b1f22cd8b8831e6bf40e248b9713959e76bd71aab43b53a9a4c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FC468F18_DCC6_46B6_AD08_05BC3BCEDF6C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and there she saw a strange, vagrant man standing in the moonlight. ⟪k:1⟫His clothes were "
"tattered, his bearded face bony and emaciated."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫月明かりを背負う、⟪k:1⟫見知らぬひとりの男を。⟪k:2⟫服も擦り切れ、⟪k:3⟫憔悴しきった顔には伸ばし"
"たままの髭が生えた、⟪k:4⟫浮浪の者を。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8A71D3D9_E307_411B_ABF6_BB00BFBB53DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 671858632073a133c5cd35389defc5fc5224396eb8f87070ef6da229d9cfcf6f
#. default-sha256: f8e757579e61537e984ae3d6e3d0fbd98a11ac57df40199ed4e71b34d156e002
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8A71D3D9_E307_411B_ABF6_BB00BFBB53DD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫………ッ！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3595D187_60FD_4829_86D6_7B456706EDD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96c75671e35e1c0cbfc8a837559fc840d5ec89fbfb7780be1891a4666f8cb01f
#. default-sha256: 2090f5c8b4081bc3d1635f091e6d22ee8e0bcc25355ce2f6372f0f3878487a22
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3595D187_60FD_4829_86D6_7B456706EDD3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She gasped, shrinking back several paces. ⟪k:1⟫The heavy door began to swing shut, but the "
"man forced it open,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女は息を呑み、⟪k:1⟫咄嗟に後ずさりました。⟪k:2⟫けれど、⟪k:3⟫重みのまま自然に閉じようとする扉"
"を、⟪k:4⟫その男はこじ開け……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DCDC200C_5930_4228_A84C_5A1555F94B21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebd922293574cbdb9573d34d37fdea8b982afdda6a89f83914561ba2c7e4acc9
#. default-sha256: aebe42ed22cc28d346c28c9dfdb414d11237701d51d4b62f96fbb3e4c218c20e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DCDC200C_5930_4228_A84C_5A1555F94B21"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫glaring down at her with unfocused eyes and mumbling,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女をうろんな瞳で見下ろし、⟪k:1⟫不明瞭に呟いたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0E7B69CA_31B2_4FCD_9779_175E3F94FB67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9af6d0461cbfc05bd67704ea841ae97585cc8965df80bb6b7997da156d05de0
#. default-sha256: 298916b689f75076b5be248f997363a61da55d2c05cb7ee01b6d3793aca6ea5d
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0E7B69CA_31B2_4FCD_9779_175E3F94FB67"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are ye the witch that’ll grant people’s wishes?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あんたが願いを叶えてくれる魔女か……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A34CF1FA_E92C_44D3_B497_C6503B98EBB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd3b663265a1c58620b03b4fc76c516e3c4825a5bdeeb4d563e665378b7767b7
#. default-sha256: f1a0f862a40c11990e0eb95a4d2ad42d854ddb6fe779ffe422fa9bdaaf401718
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A34CF1FA_E92C_44D3_B497_C6503B98EBB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was in that moment that the White-Haired Girl realized she had been careless. ⟪k:1⟫The "
"man had sought out the mansion because he believed the legend of the witch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――浅はかであったと悔いたのは、⟪k:1⟫この時でした。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その男は、⟪k:4⟫魔女の伝承を信じて"
"屋敷に辿り着いたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3EA1F26B_E711_4316_A68E_172EC1760EB6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21ff40eb57b96b6f11dbf7c7fb778001267ffcbc68c34f6bd993440a0697b80c
#. default-sha256: b89ceea3f772ba704530ce343774fee27562ed009f10c12d34e014d3a60d7ace
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3EA1F26B_E711_4316_A68E_172EC1760EB6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And he did not seem particularly right of mind, either—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫perhaps a result of "
"wandering through the forest for several days. Or perhaps it was ⟪k:3⟫because⟪k:4⟫ he was so "
"beaten down that he thought to ask for a witch’s help."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫幾日も彷徨った所為なのか――あるいは魔女に望みをかける程に精神を壊したのか、⟪k:1⟫その男の雰囲気"
"は尋常ではありませんでした。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7257A84_1D3E_4823_A936_F17F36BE0932
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9d9187c1dc7c4978c24933af077f2ec6942e79fa69cec5201b57de8a6f8926a
#. default-sha256: de461888e176ce1e15cb4c5b232d61944331bb2a1fb23418b7c23a6c9e3fbbb9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7257A84_1D3E_4823_A936_F17F36BE0932"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In a word, he seemed mad."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ひとことで言えば――狂気じみていたのです。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_88F28DEE_9E99_46D5_872F_3095AA05A27B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a6e143d227b39d0903b89f7b9de6f9a548e6c07125b323d2e1a200665232ee5
#. default-sha256: 04ecf904ebf511bf099a535ab6447452598e580d38525a082ef5e9486203cfe4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88F28DEE_9E99_46D5_872F_3095AA05A27B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫N-⟪k:1⟫No...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There is no witch here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ち、⟪k:1⟫ちがいます……。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ここに、⟪k:4⟫願いを叶える魔女なんて、⟪k:5⟫存在しません……。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1BE00853_0238_48B0_BA1C_28E0370C7C4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 257112c3cb81c1f2ee2ab78161606bf2ec238d7c5cb8847a8e86f0c4066e5e99
#. default-sha256: 75323dac1f51f315968b01006cc5051694d2b9f74955f0e52af36e6111cdb676
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1BE00853_0238_48B0_BA1C_28E0370C7C4D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Sure there is. Don’t ye lie to me...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I can ’ear the witch’s voice..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本当はいるんだろう？　⟪k:1⟫なあ、⟪k:2⟫嘘をつくなよ……。⟪k:3⟫俺の耳には聞こえるんだ、⟪k:4⟫魔女"
"の声が……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_880EC7AC_1F2B_4DD7_B643_47239262DAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a68e811c5494daead7690b61a2145cd70e7d52327f77fd7d8cd91dc0a04fda26
#. default-sha256: da1eee4caa198c2ee9be1ba54cc7d4196fd14c8922de9485bd4ee66849dd26ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_880EC7AC_1F2B_4DD7_B643_47239262DAF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She led me to this ’ouse!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫この館へと導く女の声が……！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_75400493_59A8_4243_BB66_2EE779585351
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57899de1f86ae836c0f5b85022da61d68c87e56eb316ce7e7d1b5d2a6fd47933
#. default-sha256: 711a0f11b4c1b93050bb4a029b245b40ecf0487698ff77b2f6cf5d344ddf8bad
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75400493_59A8_4243_BB66_2EE779585351"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ngh... ⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I promise you, there isn’t!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now please, be on your way!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ッ……、⟪k:1⟫ほ、⟪k:2⟫本当に、⟪k:3⟫違うんです！　⟪k:4⟫お願いします、⟪k:5⟫お引き取りください！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_0237B531_A3CD_4C65_886E_E37919AB5260
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 267a01b01d6d155b0c620ea836944779bc8825842b818cf96f79b0d754e34c02
#. default-sha256: d09432b8d2ecfce648be99e3b302f086fee153c52a16d051641f8fc1981628d6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0237B531_A3CD_4C65_886E_E37919AB5260"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫’Ave ye any idea ’ow long it took to find this place?!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫’Ow many days I’ve gone "
"without food or water?!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And ye’re tellin’ me to get lost?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ここまで来たのに引き取れって？　⟪k:1⟫どれくらい時間をかけたと思っているんだ！　⟪k:2⟫どれくら"
"い飲まず食わずでここまで来たと……！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_099B4492_1369_4746_AD8C_8DC846C0252B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ccaf6ef34aaa2c1d078582f9dd7864baf2e80dc48548437036417fa11d4b1ab
#. default-sha256: 4a046b499a9114d6f3b81ff9fb714167b20cf18b42b6b68c33ee70b061b8d92e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_099B4492_1369_4746_AD8C_8DC846C0252B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I don’t know what you want from me...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m happy to give you a little food, "
"so please!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そ、⟪k:1⟫そんなこと、⟪k:2⟫言われても……。⟪k:3⟫少しの食糧なら、⟪k:4⟫お渡ししますから。⟪k:5⟫お願"
"い……！"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1A36B37C_383A_4DC1_8071_2124A926CB5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccc9ef5bd06b4273cef3ffc4033914f955f3e2765eafed6cbea74f02da4c4a7a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1A36B37C_383A_4DC1_8071_2124A926CB5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_243F0BF8_9390_4410_8605_330C9EF078E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de78d2eb004892bd9f59e930276c469d37addb0a09ade5f72c97da90e2d22154
#. default-sha256: 5bea182a03bd9ed8c9a13539c57a4da7d9fb6b5a84645688e38ee1578e30fca0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_243F0BF8_9390_4410_8605_330C9EF078E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is there really no witch?"
